From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: denfry <dabinayo@pm.me>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:31:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Make boss bars thread-safe

Boss bars are shared between regions: players join and leave on their
own region, plugins update Bukkit and Adventure boss bars from any
thread. Guard the player sets with the boss event monitor, which is
also the monitor saved data is encoded under, and hand out snapshots
instead of live views.

